        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dhisayaashii Derbiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Eliyaashiib oo ahaa wadaadkii sare ayaa la kacay wadaaddadii walaalihiis ahaa, oo waxay dhiseen Iriddii Idaha, oo intay quduus ka dhigeen ayay albaabbadeedii qotomiyeen, oo waxay quduus ka dhigeen tan iyo Munaaraddii Mee'aah iyo ilaa Munaaraddii Xananeel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa dhisay dadkii Yerixoo, oo intii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa dhisay Sakuur ina Imrii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriddii Kalluunkana waxaa dhisay reer Hasenaa'aah, oo waxay saareen alwaaxdii saqafka haysay, wayna taageen albaabbadeedii oo geliyeen handarraabbadeedii iyo qataarradeedii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Mereemood ina Uuriyaah, oo ahaa reer Xaqoos. Oo intii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Meshullaam ina Berekyaah oo ahaa ina Mesheysabeel. Oo intii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Saadooq ina Bacanaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meeshii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey reer Teqooca, laakiinse kuwoodii gobta ahaa waxba kama qaban shuqulkii sayidkooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriddii Gabowdayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Yooyaadaac oo ahaa ina Faasee'ax iyo Meshullaam oo ahaa ina Besoodyaah, oo waxay saareen alwaaxdii saqafka haysay, wayna taageen albaabbadeedii oo geliyeen handarraabbadeedii iyo qataarradeedii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meeshii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Melatyaah oo ahaa reer Gibecoon, iyo Yaadoon oo ahaa reer Meeronotii, iyo dadkii reer Gibecoon, iyo kuwii reer Misfaah, oo ku hoos jiray carshiga taliyaha webiga ka shisheeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Cusii'eel oo ahaa ina Xarhayaah oo ka mid ahaa dahabtumayaashii. Oo meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Xananyaah oo ka mid ahaa dawosameeyayaashii, oo waxay Yeruusaalem adkeeyeen tan iyo derbiga ballaadhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meeshii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Refaayaah oo ahaa ina Xuur oo ahaa taliyihii dhistarigii Yeruusaalem badhkiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meeshii iyaga ku xigtay oo ka soo hor jeedday gurigiisa waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Yedacyaah oo ahaa ina Xaruumaf. Meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa dhisay Xatuush oo ahaa ina Xashabneyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malkiiyaah ina Xaarim iyo Xashuub ina Faxad Moo'aabna waxay cusboonaysiiyeen meel kale iyo Munaaraddii Foornooyinka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Shalluum ina Hallooxeesh oo ahaa taliyihii dhistariga Yeruusaalem badhkiis, isagii iyo gabdhihiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriddii Dooxadana waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Xaanuun iyo dadkii Saanoo'ax degganaa. Iyagu way dhiseen, oo waxay qotomiyeen albaabbadeedii oo geliyeen handarraabbadeedii iyo qataarradeedii, oo waxay dhiseen kun dhudhun oo derbigii ah tan iyo Iriddii Digada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriddii Digadana waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Malkiiyaah ina Reekaab oo ahaa taliyihii dhistariga Beyd Hakerem; wuu dhisay, wuuna qotomiyey albaabbadeedii oo geliyey handarraabbadeedii iyo qataarradeedii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriddii Isha biyaha ahna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Shalluun ina Kaalxoseh oo ahaa taliyihii dhistariga Misfaah, wuu dhisay oo deday, oo wuxuu qotomiyey albaabbadeedii oo geliyey handarraabbadeedii iyo qataarradeedii, oo derbigii Warta Shelax oo beerta boqorka u dhowaana wuu dhisay, oo wuxuu gaadhsiiyey tan iyo jaranjarada hoos uga degata magaalada Daa'uud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Nexemyaah ina Casbuuq oo ahaa taliyihii dhistariga Beytsuur badhkiis, oo isagu wuxuu dhisay tan iyo meesha ka soo hor jeedda xabaalihii Daa'uud, iyo tan iyo balligii la sameeyey, iyo tan iyo gurigii ragga xoogga badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey reer Laawi oo Rexuum ina Baanii ka mid ahaa. Meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Xashabyaah oo ahaa taliyihii dhistariga Qeciilaah badhkiis oo dhistarigiisa aawadiis ayuu u dhisay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey walaalahood oo uu ka mid ahaa Baway ina Xeenaadaad oo ahaa taliyihii dhistariga Qeciilaah badhkiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meel kale oo isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Ceser ina Yeeshuuca oo ahaa taliyihii Misfaah, taas oo ahayd meel ka soo hor jeedda meesha loo fuulo maqsinka hubka oo ku ag yiil meeshuu derbigu ka leexdo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meel kale oo isaga ku xigtayna waxaa dadaal ku cusboonaysiiyey Baaruug ina Sabbay, tan iyo leexashada derbiga iyo ilaa albaabkii guriga Eliyaashiib oo ahaa wadaadka sare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meel kale oo isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Mereemood ina Uuriyaah oo ahaa reer Xaqoos, tan iyo guriga Eliyaashiib albaabkiisa iyo ilaa guriga Eliyaashiib dabadiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey wadaaddadii ahaa dadkii Bannaanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeshii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Benyaamiin iyo Xashuub taas oo ahayd meel guryahooda ka soo hor jeedday. Meeshii iyaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Casaryaah ina Macaseeyaah oo ahaa reer Cananyaah, taas oo ahayd gurigiisa dhinaciisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meel kale oo isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Binnuwii ina Xeenaadaad, taas oo ka bilaabmaysay gurigii Casaryaah ilaa meeshuu derbigu ka leexdo iyo tan iyo derbiga geeskiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faalaal ina Uusayna wuxuu cusboonaysiiyey meel leexashadii derbiga ka soo hor jeedday iyo munaaraddii ka taagnayd gurigii boqorka oo sare ee u dhowaa barxaddii waardiyayaasha, oo meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Fedaayaah ina Farcosh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Haddaba reer Netiiniim waxay degganaayeen Cofel iyo tan iyo meel ka soo hor jeedday Iridda Biyaha oo xagga bari, iyo ilaa munaaraddii kor u taagnayd.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meel kale oo isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey reer Teqooca, taasoo ka soo hor jeedday munaaraddii weynayd oo kor u taagnayd, iyo tan iyo derbigii Cofel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriddii Faraska korkeedana waxaa cusboonaysiiyey wadaaddadii, oo mid waluba wuxuu sameeyey meeshii gurigiisa ka soo hor jeedday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Saadooq ina Immeer, taasoo ahayd meel gurigiisa ka soo hor jeedday. Meel kale oo isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Shemacyaah ina Shekaanyaah oo ahaa kii dhawri jiray Iridda Bari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meel kale oo isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Xananyaah ina Shelemyaah iyo Xaanuun oo ahaa Saalaaf wiilkiisii lixaad. Meeshii isaga ku xigtayna waxaa cusboonaysiiyey Meshullaam ina Berekyaah, taasoo ahayd meel qolkiisii ka soo hor jeedday. ",
